OL,3,GNEWSALifeboat crew rescues unconscious
OL,4,Asailor at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifeboat crew has helped rescue an
OL,7,Funconscious sailor who suffered head
OL,8,Finjuries while on a vessel anchored off
OL,9,Fthe Suffolk coast.
OL,11,FThe RNLI attended the vessel anchored
OL,12,Fin Bawdsey, east of Felixstowe,
OL,13,Ffollowing a call at 13:28 GMT on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FA coastguard rescue helicopter was also
OL,17,Fsent to the incident, and the casualty
OL,18,Fwas winched aboard after RNLI crew
OL,19,Fmembers helped with initial care.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
